+            "tooltip": "How long the video will really be, in seconds. This is the frame count divided by the frame rate, so it matches the picture exactly. Use it for anything that has to line up with the video, such as audio length. It can differ slightly from the number you picked, because rounding to the model's pattern changes the length a little."
