+            "tooltip": "Phantom pass-through used to CHAIN Mute Switches. Wire this into another Mute Switch's input row; toggling that outer row OFF will then also mute every node THIS switch controls (cascade). For normal data flow, wire your real nodes directly into Mute Switch rows - this output carries no real data."
